Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add thank-you page as a stop between checkout and
 dashboard

Both logged-in and guest purchase flows now land on /thank-you (single
course and bundle) before continuing to /dashboard, instead of hitting
the dashboard directly. Updates the Stripe checkout success URLs and
the guest auto-login redirect in post-purchase to point there.

